<title>USA: Timber Lodge Steakhouse launches eatery.</title>
<headline>Timber Lodge Steakhouse launches eatery.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timber Lodge Steakhouse Inc said Tuesday it has begun construction of its first restaurant in the Chicago area.</p>
<p>The company said the new Timber Lodge Steakhouse in Naperville, Illinois, is scheduled to open in late March.</p>
<p>It currently operates 12 restaurants in Minnesota, South Dakota, Wisconsin and New York State.</p>
<p>Timber Lodge Steakhouse shares were trading down 1/8 Tuesday afternoon at 4-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
